# Local models in Cursor

`registry/local-models.json` is the roster. `references/cursor-local-models.json` is the Cursor picker pack.

Authorized inference is Ollama Cloud through Codex desktop `local-ai-worker` tools `ollama_cloud_status` and `ollama_cloud_run`. Do not download or launch new local models or purchase anything.

Cursor backend cannot reach desktop loopback. Do not enable Override OpenAI Base URL or add custom models as localhost BYOK.

Cloud Agents keep Cursor-hosted models. Do not pull Ollama weights, change OmniRoute defaults, write API keys, edit `state.vscdb`, or enable tunnels from this roster.

